[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546310908","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112898#issuecomment-3546310908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112898","id":3546310908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TYGj8","user":{"login":"vibrant-reindeer","id":159484964,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYGMJA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159484964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer","html_url":"https://github.com/vibrant-reindeer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T09:00:40Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T09:54:58Z","body":"Edit: **Disregard this message.** I found a simple, generic workaround after all. See next message.\n\n~~To others looking for a workaround: I found a very specific solution for my own use case. All of the sprites in my game use the same palette. So I set the palette as a non-instance parameter and then use two indices into the palette as instance parameters:~~\n\n```diff\n-shader_type canvas_item;\n-\n-uniform sampler2D palette: filter_nearest;\n-instance uniform int original_color_index;\n-instance uniform int replacement_color_index;\n-\n-void fragment() {\n-\tvec4 pixel_color = texture(TEXTURE, UV);\n-\tvec4 original_color = texelFetch(palette, ivec2(original_color_index, 0), 0);\n-\tvec4 replacement_color = texelFetch(palette, ivec2(replacement_color_index, 0), 0);\n-\tif (pixel_color == original_color) {\n-\t\tCOLOR = replacement_color;\n-\t}\n-}\n```\n\n~~I could not find a generic workaround. Failed attempts:~~\n\n~~* Programmatically converting the Color parameters with srgb_to_linear() or linear_to_srgb() before passing them to the shader: Results in different colors but still not the correct ones.~~\n~~* Replacing the Color parameters with 1x1 textures (sampler2D) of the desired color: Doesn't compile because the instance qualifier is not supported for sampler types.~~\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546310908/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546549278","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112898#issuecomment-3546549278","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112898","id":3546549278,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TZAwe","user":{"login":"vibrant-reindeer","id":159484964,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYGMJA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159484964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer","html_url":"https://github.com/vibrant-reindeer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T09:51:10Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T09:51:10Z","body":"There is a much simpler and generic workaround after all: Instead of using the `source_color` hint just use a plain `vec4` and do the conversion manually:\n\n```glsl\nshader_type canvas_item;\n\ninstance uniform vec4 original_color;\ninstance uniform vec4 replacement_color;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tvec4 pixel_color = texture(TEXTURE, UV);\n\tif (pixel_color == original_color) {\n\t\tCOLOR = replacement_color;\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _color_to_vec4(color: Color) -> Vector4:\n\treturn Vector4(color.r, color.g, color.b, color.a)\n\nfunc _change_color(color: Color):\n\tsprite.set_instance_shader_parameter(\"replacement_color\", _color_to_vec4(color))\n```\n\n[workaround_for_instanceshaderparametertest_2025-11-18_10-47-38.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23602961/workaround_for_instanceshaderparametertest_2025-11-18_10-47-38.zip)\n\n<img width=\"712\" height=\"401\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46996fba-ecbc-4f1a-88b3-0ff8c71690f2\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546549278/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3546897275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112898#issuecomment-3546897275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112898","id":3546897275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TaVt7","user":{"l