rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibrant-reindeer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T11:55:09Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T11:55:09Z","body":"> Sounds like:\n> \n>     * [2D instance uniform with source_color flag incorrectly shows in Vulkan #102746](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102746)\n\nI agree. It's just the title of that issue makes it sound like it's only a visual bug while really it's the parameters that are not passed correctly to the shader. That's not to say I disagree with closing this as a duplicate, just that other people might be confused by the other issue's title as well.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3547257221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3547351491","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112898#issuecomment-3547351491","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112898","id":3547351491,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TcEnD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T12:15:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T12:15:46Z","body":"I don't think the title implies that it is a strictly visual issue (though, as we're talking about shaders, I don't think it being visual or not matters)\n\nClosing as a duplicate, please add any details you feel are missing to that issue","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3547351491/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]